# Halfords
Halfords is a UK retailer and service provider specialising in motoring, cycling, vehicle maintenance, tyres, batteries, servicing, and related accessories.

Primary audience:
- UK consumers
- Vehicle owners
- Cyclists
- Customers seeking vehicle servicing and repairs

